   Atlas theme: a calm, document-first workspace look (warm greys, one blue
   accent, the system UI font, airy page column).

   Scope: the Atlas canvas (`.admin-tool.ws-atlas`, nested inside the host's
   admin shell so the host chrome keeps its own look) and `body.ws-atlas`
   (set while Atlas is mounted) for portaled menus, popovers and dialogs.
   Only --ws-* tokens and Atlas-scoped rules live here; workspace.css stays
   the theme for the rest of admin.
